    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-02T22:17:06+05:30\"\u003eJune 2, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e10:17 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission UPSSSC\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e As per the latest official update, the Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission\u003cstrong\u003e (UPSSSC)\u003c/strong\u003e has released the \u003cstrong\u003eExam Calendar for 2025–2026.\u003c/strong\u003e It includes the schedule for various recruitment examinations such as \u003cstrong\u003eForest Guard, Forest \u0026amp; Wildlife Guard, Nakshanavish, Manchitrak, Stenographer, Junior Assistant and Various others Post.\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates planning to appear for these \u003cstrong\u003eexams\u003c/strong\u003e can now check their exam dates and download their \u003cstrong\u003eadmit cards.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Exam Information 2026 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsssc-exam-calendar-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date : \u003cstrong\u003eNotify Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card Date : \u003cstrong\u003eBefore Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNot Available.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eAge Limit Details\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003eNot Available\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Exam Information 2025 : Recruitment Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Name\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Conducted By\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUPSSSC Various Posts Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission UPSSSC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download The UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"273\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"189\"\u003eVisit the official website\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;of the Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission —\u0026nbsp;\u003cem data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"270\"\u003eupsssc.gov.in\u003c/em\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"357\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, go to the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"322\"\u003e“Notice Board”\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"346\"\u003e“Latest Updates”\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;section.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"423\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the link that says\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"421\"\u003e“UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026.”\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"501\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eA\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"441\"\u003ePDF file\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;containing the full schedule of upcoming exams will open.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"586\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"525\"\u003eDownload the PDF\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and check the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"573\"\u003eexam names, dates, and stages\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;carefully.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"663\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eYou can also\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"622\"\u003etake a printout\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for easy reference and future updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDownload Updated Exam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in//ViewPdf.aspx?oYEmOWynQkSzyPE3pqkE/fxjG2EnU7bWLmOM17w09Iw=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDownload Exam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ViewPdf.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"\u003eUPSSSC\u003c/span\u003e Official Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/span\u003e : Important Question\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ1. What is the UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The \u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/strong\u003e provides the schedule of exams conducted by the \u003cstrong\u003e(UPSSSC)\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003evarious posts\u003c/strong\u003e, including application start and end dates, examination dates, and result timelines.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ3. What are the key exams listed in the UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The key exams include: Forest Guard, Forest \u0026amp; Wildlife Guard, Nakshanavish, Manchitrak, Stenographer, Junior Assistant and Various Post.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ2. Where can I download the UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA:\u003c/strong\u003e The UPSSSC Exam Calendar can be downloaded from the official \u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC website\u003c/strong\u003e at \u003ca target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003essc.nic.in\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-25650 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/upsc-2026-Calendar-1747298640168-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"UPSSSC Exam Calendar 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/upsc-2026-Calendar-1747298640168-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/upsc-2026-Calendar-1747298640168-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.